{
  "name": "folder-scaffold",
  "displayName": "Folder Scaffold",
  "description": "新建文件夹时按设置自动创建 __init__.py、index.ts、index.tsx 等文件",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "publisher": "local",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "folderScaffold.openSettings",
        "title": "Folder Scaffold: 打开设置"
      },
      {
        "command": "folderScaffold.newFromTemplate",
        "title": "按模板新建文件夹",
        "category": "Folder Scaffold"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "explorer/context": [
        {
          "command": "folderScaffold.newFromTemplate",
          "when": "folderScaffold.hasTemplates && (explorerResourceIsFolder || explorerResourceIsFile)",
          "group": "3_folderScaffold@1"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "folderScaffold.newFromTemplate",
          "when": "folderScaffold.hasTemplates"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Folder Scaffold",
      "properties": {
        "folderScaffold.enabled": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "是否在新建文件夹时自动创建文件。"
        },
        "folderScaffold.defaultFiles": {
          "type": "array",
          "default": [
            "__init__.py"
          ],
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "markdownDescription": "没有规则命中时，在新建文件夹里创建这些文件。改成 `[\"index.ts\"]` 或 `[\"index.tsx\"]` 即可更换默认文件；设为 `[]` 则默认不创建。"
        },
        "folderScaffold.rules": {
          "type": "array",
          "default": [],
          "markdownDescription": "按顺序匹配新建文件夹的工作区相对路径。命中第一条后，只创建该规则的 `files`，不再使用 `defaultFiles`。`files` 为空表示命中后不创建任何文件。",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "pattern",
              "files"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "pattern": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "文件夹相对路径的 glob。例如 **/components/**，或用 ** 匹配所有文件夹。"
              },
              "files": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "要创建的文件名，例如 __init__.py、index.ts、index.tsx。"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "folderScaffold.exclude": {
          "type": "array",
          "default": [
            "**/node_modules/**",
            "**/.git/**",
            "**/.venv/**",
            "**/venv/**",
            "**/dist/**",
            "**/build/**",
            "**/__pycache__/**",
            "**/.vscode/**",
            "**/.cursor/**"
          ],
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "命中这些 glob 的新建文件夹不会自动创建文件。"
        },
        "folderScaffold.templates": {
          "type": "array",
          "default": [
            { "title": "Python 包", "files": ["__init__.py"] },
            { "title": "组件", "files": ["index.tsx"] }
          ],
          "markdownDescription": "右键「按模板新建文件夹」后，按顺序列出前 8 条有效模板。列表上的名字来自 `title`；`title` 留空时显示「模板 N」。`files` 是新建子文件夹中要创建的相对路径；空数组只建文件夹。非对象或 `files` 不是数组的项会跳过，不占槽位。",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["files"],
            "properties": {
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "模板列表里显示的名字。留空时使用「模板 N」。"
              },
              "files": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": { "type": "string" },
                "description": "要创建的相对路径，例如 __init__.py、index.tsx、nested/index.ts。"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc -p ./",
    "watch": "tsc -watch -p ./",
    "test": "tsc -p ./ && node out/rules.test.js && node out/templates.test.js && node out/skip.test.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "minimatch": "^5.1.6"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/minimatch": "^5.1.2",
    "@types/node": "^16.18.126",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.85.0",
    "typescript": "^5.4.5"
  }
}
